the top-level instance
model vsource vsource
parameters a=1.0
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=10.0
control
  analysis op1 op
  alter instance("__topinst__") a=2.0
  analysis op2 op
  sweep sa instance="__topinst__" parameter="a" values=[1, 2, 4]
    analysis d1 op
  sweep sb instance="__topinst__" parameter="a" values=[1, 2]
    analysis t1 tran stop=1u
endc
